# avaliacao class

Compile with **LuaLaTeX** only (`fontspec`, `unicode-math`, `libertine`). Language is Portuguese.

## Document skeleton

```tex
\documentclass[12pt,a4paper,twocols,margin=1.20cm]{avaliacao}
\begin{document}
\universidade{...}\faculdade{...}\curso{...}\disciplina{...}
\semestre{...}\assunto{...}\turno{...}\professor{...}
\header
\begin{instrucoes}
  \item ...
\end{instrucoes}
\end{document}
```

Class options: `twocols`, `keys` (print answer keys), `10pt`/`11pt`/`12pt`, plus `geometry` options.

## Questions

- `\begin{questao}{<pts>}...\end{questao}` — points in the mandatory argument (use `1,5` not `1.5`).
- Optional first arg is the answer key, shown only with `keys`: `\begin{questao}[075]{1}` or `\begin{questao}[4/8/60]{2}`.
- True/false: `vf` + `\qitem{V}` / `\qitem{F}`.
- Multiple choice: `me` (optional columns, default 1) + `\qitem{X}` for the correct option, `\qitem{}` otherwise.
- Subitems: `subitens`. Shared stem: `obs`.

```tex
\begin{questao}{1}
\begin{me}[2]
  \qitem{}  wrong
  \qitem{X} correct
\end{me}
\end{questao}
```

## Commands

Prefer `\valor{80}{km/h}` and `\unidade{m/s}` for quantities. Header aliases exist in PT/EN (`\universidade`/`\university`, …). Do not rename public macros in `avaliacao.cls`.
